    <p>
      Later design specs (<code>15</code> through <code>29</code>, including
      <code>26-tool-consolidation.md</code> and <code>28-native-ai-architecture.md</code>) own
      contracts the roadmap sequences. The roadmap’s snapshot says spec 26 has not landed and
      that <code>tools/action.ts</code> is absent. The file is present at
      <code>packages/ai/src/tools/action.ts</code>. That does not change the snapshot’s status
      sentence, and it does not make spec 26 the current step. Do not start that work as RM-01
      unless <code>specs/roadmap/01-action-catalogue.md</code> tells you to edit that file.
      <code>specs/20-integral-roadmap.md</code> and <code>specs/21-integration-master-plan.md</code>
      are not the sequence.
    </p>
  </section>

