        <tr>
          <td><code>packages/core/src/cam/program/</code></td>
          <td>Absent. <code>packages/core/src/cam/index.ts</code> does not export a <code>program</code> namespace. <code>setup.ts</code> and <code>program-evidence.ts</code> do exist.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
